## Part D — Wire Up StoryVideoViewModel to Use PromptParser

### D1. Refactor `StoryVideoViewModel.cs`
Find the `ExtractPromptsFromText` method (lines ~924-1100) and the `CleanPrompt` method (lines ~1102-1148).

Replace the body of `ExtractPromptsFromText` with a delegation to `PromptParser`:
```csharp
private List<string> ExtractPromptsFromText(string text)
{
    return PromptParser.ExtractPrompts(text);
}
```

If the method is called elsewhere in the class, you can also replace the call sites directly with `PromptParser.ExtractPrompts(text)` and delete `ExtractPromptsFromText` entirely.

Replace any calls to the local `CleanPrompt` method with `PromptParser.CleanPrompt(...)` and delete the local `CleanPrompt` method.

**Build and verify the final result.**

