- Replaced all 6 calls to local `CleanPrompt()` method with `PromptParser.CleanPrompt()`
- **Note:** Did NOT replace `ExtractPromptsFromText` with `PromptParser.ExtractPrompts()` because the video-specific parsing logic (Video Clip #N patterns, time indicators, meta-commentary removal) is unique to this class and not handled by the generic `PromptParser`
